sequenceDiagram
    participant Authority as Authority User
    participant Gate as eFTI Gate (eu-xx01)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GateFI as Remote Gate (eu-yy01)
    participant GateDE as Remote Gate (eu-yy02)
    participant GateSE as Remote Gate (eu-yy03)

    Authority->>+Gate: GET /v1/identifiers/456XYZ?registrationCountryCode=FI
    Note over Authority,Gate: Accept: text/event-stream<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>(is_authority / is_admin)<br/>X-Request-ID echoed.

    Gate->>Gate: Validate JWT (signature, exp, iss, aud,<br/>not in `sessions` denylist),<br/>require is_admin OR is_authority

    Gate->>+DB: Local identifier search:<br/>resolve latest consignments rows matching vehicle_plate='456XYZ' AND vehicle_country='FI',<br/>keep only those whose latest status = 'active'.
    DB-->>-Gate: 0 results

    Note over Gate: Broadcast decision:<br/>local=0, force=false<br/>→ broadcast to all<br/>ONLINE peer gates.

    Gate->>+DB: Resolve all peer gates whose latest row has status='ONLINE' and is_active=TRUE<br/>(excluding self).
    DB-->>-Gate: [eu-yy01, eu-yy02, eu-yy03, eu-yy04, eu-yy05, eu-yy06]

    Note over Gate: Open SSE stream<br/>to authority.
    Gate-->>Authority: HTTP 200 OK (text/event-stream)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"eu-xx01","responseTimeMs":6,"consignments":null}

    par Broadcast to all online gates (parallel, non-blocking)
        Gate->>+GateFI: eDelivery AS4 / Fast SOAP: IdentifierQueryRequest<br/>(id="456XYZ", countryCode="FI", requestId="req-b2c3d4e5")
        Gate->>+GateDE: eDelivery AS4 / Fast SOAP: IdentifierQueryRequest<br/>(id="456XYZ", countryCode="FI", requestId="req-b2c3d4e5")
        Gate->>+GateSE: eDelivery AS4 / Fast SOAP: IdentifierQueryRequest<br/>(id="456XYZ", countryCode="FI", requestId="req-b2c3d4e5")
    end

    GateFI->>GateFI: Query local DB, find 1 result
    GateFI-->>-Gate: IdentifierQueryResponse (1 consignment)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"eu-yy01","responseTimeMs":187}
    Gate-->>Authority: event: consignment (id=a1b2c3d4-...)\ndata: {"vehicle":{"plate":"456XYZ","country":"FI"},"uil":{"gateId":"eu-yy01","platformId":"plt-xxx-001","datasetId":"a1b2c3d4-..."}}

    GateDE->>GateDE: Query local DB, 0 results
    GateDE-->>-Gate: IdentifierQueryResponse (0 consignments)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"eu-yy02","responseTimeMs":203}

    GateSE->>GateSE: Query local DB, 0 results
    GateSE-->>-Gate: IdentifierQueryResponse (0 consignments)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"eu-yy03","responseTimeMs":219}

    Note over Gate: All gates responded<br/>(or 8s timeout hit).

    Gate-->>Authority: event: complete\ndata: {}
    Gate-->>-Authority: SSE stream closed
    Note over Authority: 1 consignment received<br/>from eu-yy01.<br/>6 gates queried (~220ms).
